[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4080.63, "timestamp": "01:08:00", "text": "我的天啊，我的帧数要掉到风扇上了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4085.029, "timestamp": "01:08:05", "text": "哦，对了，我的风扇不转了。哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4088.549, "timestamp": "01:08:08", "text": "哦，不。我该怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4091.91, "timestamp": "01:08:11", "text": "我把这件事忘了。呃，我的显卡风扇有问题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4093.51, "timestamp": "01:08:13", "text": "是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4102.309, "timestamp": "01:08:22", "text": "我的天哪。卡顿得厉害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4105.349, "timestamp": "01:08:25", "text": "你们都能看出延迟了吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4107.349, "timestamp": "01:08:27", "text": "我希望我不是唯一一个这样想的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4110.47, "timestamp": "01:08:30", "text": "目睹这一切。就像是30帧/秒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4114.149, "timestamp": "01:08:34", "text": "或者像那样抖动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4116.55, "timestamp": "01:08:36", "text": "四处抖动。我站着也没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4118.229, "timestamp": "01:08:38", "text": "仍然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4121.189, "timestamp": "01:08:41", "text": "所有东西都处于最低价。非常非常低。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4123.269, "timestamp": "01:08:43", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4126.149, "timestamp": "01:08:46", "text": "我的天哪，"}]